{"path":"memory/shared_ptr/operator_bool","title":"std::shared_ptr<T>::operator bool","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::shared_ptr&lt;T&gt;::</span>operator bool","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/operator_bool","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if *this stores a non-null pointer, i.e. whether get() != nullptr.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> operator <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> stores a non-null pointer, i.e. whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">get<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> nullptr</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> stores a pointer, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>An empty shared_ptr (where <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">use_count<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>) may store a non-null pointer accessible by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/get\">get()</a></span>, e.g. if it were created using the aliasing constructor.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> report<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> ptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"*ptr=\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>ptr <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"ptr is not a valid pointer.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> ptr<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    report<span class=\"br0\">(</span>ptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    ptr <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/make_shared\"><span class=\"kw740\">std::<span class=\"me2\">make_shared</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">7</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    report<span class=\"br0\">(</span>ptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>ptr is not a valid pointer.\n*ptr=7</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/get\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the stored pointer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/shared_ptr","title":"std::shared_ptr"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::shared_ptr<T>::operator bool","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Checks if *this stores a non-null pointer, i.e. whether get() != nullptr."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if *this stores a pointer, false otherwise."},{"label":"Notes","note":"An empty shared_ptr (where use_count() == 0) may store a non-null pointer accessible by get(), e.g. if it were created using the aliasing constructor."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"get","note":"returns the stored pointer"}]}]},